  "$comment": "T-3.20. The rifleman engages from cover. With a threat known: first a grenade at a target that has sat still in cover (T-3.22, tuned in server/src/ai/throw.json) if one can be thrown clear of every friend; then any role its group gave it (T-3.21) \u2014 a suppressor fires at the pinned target without sight (reloading where it stands when low), a flanker walks the group's route to its flank point; otherwise, relocate when its point is flanked; in cover, reload when low, advance when unopposed, peek and fire a burst unless pressured (at most one peek per cooldown), else stay down; out of cover, take cover; with none to take, fight in the open. Nothing known: at ease — its posture (T-3.32), or standing down with none. Numbers are the leaves' args.",
